# Sleight of Mind changes Black Knight's color word from white to red (CR 612.2, 702.16b):
# a white spell can then target it, while a red spell cannot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet x2
Black Knight
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Sleight of Mind
Swords to Plowshares
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Knight.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight.ProtectionFrom = White
! Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sleight of Mind.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Colors(White)
Bot2.Colors(Red)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight.ProtectionFrom = Red
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Knight = (absent)
Exile = Black Knight
